OL,3,GNEWSAWe'll swim together till depth do
OL,4,Aus part
OL,5,
OL,6,FLove is in the water for a couple who
OL,7,Fgot engaged in the shark tank at
OL,8,FSkegness Aquarium.
OL,10,FJames Walsh, from Wendover,
OL,11,FBuckinghamshire, proposed to his
OL,12,Fgirlfriend Paige Cook while they were
OL,13,Ftaking part in a diving-with-sharks
OL,14,Fexperience he had bought her as a
OL,15,FChristmas present.
OL,17,FJames said he chose the Lincolnshire
OL,18,Faquarium as it was "somewhere
OL,19,Fdifferent, somewhere unique, and
OL,20,Fsomewhere memorable".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
