OL,3,GNEWSAWe'll swim together till depth do
OL,4,Aus part
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaige added: "This [was] the best day
OL,7,Fof my life. I've always wanted to go
OL,8,Fscuba diving and swimming with sharks.
OL,9,FThen [the proposal] happened and I
OL,10,Fcompletely forgot I was in a tank!"
